    "scope": "Four independent hosts on shared filesystem; same-host live writer retries. Alternating old/new order. 2 KiB/8 MiB real payloads. Two failures per case. n=8 pooled failure timings and n=4 retry timings per size/mode/phase; p99=max. Separate deliberately injected syscall errors, not natural faults or power-loss certification. No cache eviction or controlled background load. Logical namespace bytes, not physical storage reclamation. No new TB bandwidth claim.",
    "data_cleaned": true,
    "remote_cleanup": {
      "client-1": true,
      "client-2": true,
      "client-3": true,
      "client-4": true
    }
